00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.830
You girls are certainly making an effort.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:19.620
You want me to join your legion, Hitotsuyanagi?

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:22.040
Our classmate Kuo Shenlin.

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:27.790
She's an exchange student from Taipei
who's been at Yurigaoka since junior-high.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:28.450
--She may be a first-year, but her
abilities as a Lily are highly regarded.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:32.410
--Umm, it's Yuyu's legion, and...
--She may be a first-year, but her
abilities as a Lily are highly regarded.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:34.790
I see. I'd be honored.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.870
Umm, does that mean...?

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:40.040
I humbly accept your invitation.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.500
You mean it?!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.620
Thank you very much!

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.250
Please, call me Riri.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.870
All right, Riri.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.250
And?

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.450
You are?

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.790
Me?

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:56.000
Wang Yujia. She's a first-year,
but in a different class.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.580
She comes from Reykjavík, Iceland.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:01.660
Her older and younger
sisters are great Lilies, too.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:05.450
My sisters are amazing, but I'm really not.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:06.620
How about it?

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:10.540
Why not join along with Shenlin?

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:13.330
Me, join a legion?

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:18.160
If you're not confident, don't do it.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.080
Huh?

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:22.250
Yeah, I won't.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.000
--What?

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.290
--She's quite obedient.
--What?

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.120
B-But why?

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:30.580
Because if Shenlin says so, it must be right.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:34.370
Umm, have you known each other for a long time?

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:37.450
No, we met this spring.

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:39.790
Then why...?

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:44.330
To become a Lily, and to stay a Lily,

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.540
I've worked myself to the bone.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:51.620
Isn't that enough of a reason?

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:56.120
I don't have talent or experience,

00:13:56.120 --> 00:14:00.910
and I don't have your
confidence, Shenlin, but...

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:02.290
No.

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:05.870
<i>Because </i>I don't, I won't know
unless I see for myself!

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:08.660
You're being obstinate again.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.450
Of course, that's part of your charm.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:20.700
Excuse me.

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:25.540
You want to see what Yujia can do, right, Riri?

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:26.410
Huh?

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.870
I didn't mean to sound arrogant or...

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:31.330
Thank you, Hitotsuyanagi.

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:34.040
I'll give it a try.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.200
Huh?

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.910
Is this right, Shenlin?

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:45.250
In that case, would you
let me choose the method?

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.540
Both my sisters

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:53.910
are still in Iceland fighting the Huge.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:57.750
I was the only one told to leave my homeland.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:02.910
I thought that they didn't need me.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.370
I'm sorry.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:09.580
Yurigaoka is a world-class Garden.

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:15.330
But wanting to defend your
homeland is a special feeling.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:19.450
Yeah. I understand that.

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:31.700
Can you see me, Yujia?

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.290
Yeah.

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.910
Shoot me from where you're standing.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.160
What?

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.120
It'll be fine with training rounds.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:40.950
No, it wo--

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:42.950
Load ten rounds.

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:47.540
If you aim accurately,
I'll withdraw my opposition.

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:53.250
Don't worry. You can do it.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:56.200
Why not tell her that?

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:59.250
Thank you for observing, Miss Yuyu.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:02.660
Don't mention it. It's a favor to Riri.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.830
Why?

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:08.620
Do you like cats, Yujia?

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:09.700
Huh?

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.330
Y-Yeah.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:14.120
This little kitty sure is cute.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.580
Yeah.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.790
Would you hold this for me?

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:20.750
Huh?

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.080
Sure.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:34.160
"Heaven's Measure."

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:39.700
The ability to perceive even
distant objects with zero error.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:42.450
That's Yujia's Rare Skill.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:43.950
Long-range sniping?

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.160
What's the target?

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.200
Shenlin.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:50.580
What?

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:53.160
Fire, Yujia.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:57.910
Fire, and prove that you're a first-rate Lily.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:01.330
Th-Th-That's dangerous, Yujia!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:05.830
You and Shenlin gave me a chance.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:08.660
So, I'm going to believe in you.

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:11.000
Huh? A chance?

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:20.700
Yujia is about a kilometer away.

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:24.950
Her Asterion's bullets have an initial
velocity of 1,800 meters per second.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:27.870
I have about enough time to blink.

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:31.580
If she's accurate, I can dodge.

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:33.950
If she's accurate? I see.

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.660
You won't use your usual CHARM?

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:39.700
I want an even playing field.

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:57.450
The wind.

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:02.580
The bullet... will blow off course.

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:12.160
The wind again.

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:14.040
Should I let it pass?

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.950
No, I can do it!

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:37.250
Ten shots.

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:40.290
"Kuo Shenlin"
"Incoming call"

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.200
Well done, Yujia.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:44.870
Shenlin.

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:50.160
Now it should be obvious to
everyone that you're an amazing Lily.

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:54.160
You did it!

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:55.950
Thank you, Riri.

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:57.410
Huh?

00:18:57.410 --> 00:19:04.700
Because you complimented my cat charm,
and I wanted to join your legion.

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.700
You're thanking me for that?

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:09.290
Yes, thank you.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:12.120
Thank you very much, Miss Yuyu.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:15.750
No, you performed admirably.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:19.700
I was jealous of Yujia.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:24.410
She was born into an elite
family and blessed with talent,

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:28.700
but she was nervous and
couldn't believe in herself.

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.200
Who did she think she was?

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:34.120
Doesn't it make you mad?

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:37.660
Were you... always angry at her?

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:41.250
Yes, but now I feel relieved.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:47.620
I'm not one to talk, but you're
an awfully difficult person.

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.580
I get that a lot.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:56.250
Shenlin... thanks for today.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.410
You're welcome.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.410
And sorry.

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:07.450
I heard that your homeland
was swallowed by the Huge.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:11.080
That's right. I don't know my homeland.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.040
I was insensitive.

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:14.660
I...

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:19.700
Has that been bothering you?

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:23.660
I've found a comrade
I can trust to watch my back.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:28.450
If you're happy, then so am I.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.580
Yeah.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.040
I'm glad I got to come here.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.830
That makes seven.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:40.500
We just need two more to form a legion!

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.750
I wish they could all be as easy as Miriam.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:47.040
You'd better not be picking a quarrel with me.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:51.700
Still, I feel like this is
shaping up to be a great legion.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:58.580
I apologize for calling you at a time like this.

00:20:58.580 --> 00:20:58.870
"Izue Shinobu"                "Mashima Moyu"

00:20:58.580 --> 00:20:58.870
I apologize for calling you at a time like this.

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:00.450
"Izue Shinobu"                "Mashima Moyu"

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:00.450
Don't mention it!

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:01.540
"Izue Shinobu"                "Mashima Moyu"

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:01.540
I'm awake round-the-clock anyway.

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:01.580
I'm awake round-the-clock anyway.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:03.120
"Acting chairman"
"Takamatsu Kogetsu"

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:04.790
"Acting chairman"
"Takamatsu Kogetsu"

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:04.790
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:05.080
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.870
Now, what's your report?

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:10.450
We've 'ot a 'unny new
'irst-year in Arsenal 'ivision.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:13.410
The way 'e 'alks is sho old-'ashioned.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.870
Just like you, Acting Chairman.

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:17.700
Oh, are you related?

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:19.950
No, I can't say I'm familiar.

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:21.000
Moyu?

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:24.120
Oh, this is just the preamble.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:26.620
Ahem! As you know,

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:31.910
half a century has passed since the
Huge first appeared before humanity.

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:36.910
But we are unable to decipher the
Huge's behavior or goals as a species.

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:41.370
We have our hands full just taking
them as they come. That's the reality.

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:47.200
Perhaps the Huge are too physiologically
diverse to classify as a single species?

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.950
'At's just it!

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:53.580
There are lots of theories about what
they are and where they came from,

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:59.370
but I took a slightly broader view
and looked for correlations.

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:00.580
And I found...

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:03.580
See? Here, check this out.

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:04.870
Oh-ho.

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:07.120
This is...

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:10.120
It looks like your Schild is working hard.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:11.160
"Student council, second year"
"Hata Matsuri"

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:11.160
It looks like your Schild is working hard.

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.160
"Student council, second year"
"Hata Matsuri"

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.160
To be honest, I miscalculated.

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:14.080
"Student council, second year"
"Hata Matsuri"

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:14.080
That it's working out?

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:15.370
That it's working out?

00:22:15.370 --> 00:22:19.580
I never expected people
to flock to her so easily.

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:23.950
It sounds like you have an easier time
dealing with Huge than with people.

00:22:23.950 --> 00:22:26.870
That's Yurigaoka's ace for you.

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:31.370
It sounds like you're mean.

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:33.040
I am.

